      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Harbinger forces are massing outside Cordia City but we might have detected a possible opportunity to disrupt their final assault.\n\nSince the beginning we have noticed that several DropShips were being kept back at the <i>Orion's Belt</i>, as a tactical reserve, and they are heading out now towards Coromodir.",
