      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9501f48955e55f55e13e65"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Lord Madeira, a pair of 'Mechs?\n\nWhat will that achieve?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c85cb4ceb174be0b5e4640a"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5fec0bdf47a67beb18d225"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "My <i>Kintaro</i> will be carrying one of the armed nuclear warheads with me on the controls. \n\nOnce we reach the landing zone of their command DropShip, we will deploy it and leave as quickly as possible.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cedaca0fbe8d7a6acaa6697"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce0a9f26c845ef2312cad53"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Timing the arrival of the <i>Union</i> DropShip is not going to be easy, Lady Arano.\n\nYou may find yourself out of time very easily and have no time to deploy the warhead.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "What happens if you can't leave, your Highness?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c294899cbf311302bd32c2b"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb0adee30cf1b1107b98de8"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "I will deploy the weapon whenever I have the chance to take out the Harbinger leadership, even if it means my 'Mech is still carrying it.\n\nAnd once their leaders are gone, the rest will have to decide if they want to die in more atomic clouds.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c77c2f839c5ee33501a6ff2"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c439fdf1363a02a1146f10e"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "You can't be ordering more nuclear strikes later Kamea, unless you want to literally 'salt the earth'!",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 9,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c7fff0e65719e248f8370ac"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c6cc8838d116b2a8fa5ef8c"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "And I won't Farah, that is why I chose to keep the star port. \n\nIf the Harbingers don't leave after this decapitation strike, you must evacuate and save as many as possible from Coromodir.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c39fa87f8eeade54aeccd40"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c82953bf878be4074839ab2"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "That's... that's assuming we can we leave, with the <i>Orion's Belt</i> about to arrive in orbit, and we definitely can't deploy your lance using our DropShips afterwards.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c885fe784ea252119d353ba"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5306e98542394231536fe9"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "No lance and no orbital insertion because we can't be detected approaching their landing zone until it is too late for them to reply, otherwise I will have to detonate the warhead while still carrying it in my 'Mech.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 12,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cc0704e4c656235ae99d4ca"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c945677c2af5875012d0d68"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Our forces are all guarding the main gates of Cardia City but they'll detect if we move any of them.\n\nSo we will need to use whatever else we have in storage, that is besides the <i>Kintaro</i> which is already being retrofitted. \n",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Yang, do we have anything else available?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 13,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c599dc4804c90b2fbaa0987"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce70f5b5e2f4a5194a66c00"
      },
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Alex, the Captain's <i>Kintaro</i> is still busted and we are already sweating just to replace armor and reloading magazines after we lost the Refit Yards, so we need additional help to get it ready.\n\nCommander, good news, we have salvaged one of the Harbingers' improved <i>Phoenix Hawks</i>",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
